      "subject": "בצנור",
      "rationale": "The צנור is a watershaft (compare the Gihon shaft); the clause is proverb-like and elliptical — 'whoever strikes a Jebusite shall reach the watershaft' — and translators divide over whether it names the attack route or a proverbial condition."
